"During LeafSong's exams, students led by Jel-nor illicitly summoned a mishnen to a jungle pool."
"The mishnen took the foot of Stu-art'h, son of the Primary."
"Alden Thorn was emergency-summoned into the pool and preserved Stuart and the foot."
"Worli Ro-den killed the mishnen with poison poured into the water."
"Jel-nor's spell shattered the foot into clean shards to fake a duel as the cover story."
"The foot was reattached at a House of Healing; Stuart was back within days in a gel boot."
"The students' families paid, the head medic was bribed, and Ro-den took nine contracts."
